        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>法国传统甜点介绍</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf6e9 0%, #fbeed6 40%, #f8e6c8 100%);\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 715px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 26px 22px 20px 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 6px solid #f3e2bf;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fdf7ec 0%, #fbeedb 35%, #f7e4c6 70%, #f6e9d4 100%);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 10px;\n    left: 110px;\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 200px;\n    font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", cursive;\n    font-size: 150px;\n    color: rgba(240, 200, 120, 0.35);\n    line-height: 0.9;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n  .bg-blob {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 0;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .blob-right {\n    right: 0;\n    top: 235px;\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 130px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.55), rgba(246,226,196,0.2) 70%, rgba(246,226,196,0) 100%);\n  }\n  .blob-bottom {\n    left: 120px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 400px;\n    height: 120px;\n    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 90%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5), rgba(248,232,205,0) 75%);\n  }\n  .entry {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .figure-col {\n    flex: 0 0 130px;\n    width: 130px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 118px;\n    height: 92px;\n    margin: 0 auto 2px auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #d8b98a;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #9a7a4a;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    padding: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #b8862b;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .text-col {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    text-align: justify;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .entry-1 .text-col { padding-top: 8px; }\n  .entry-1 .figure-col .placeholder { height: 86px; }\n  .entry-3 .placeholder { height: 78px; }\n  .entry-5 .placeholder { height: 100px; }\n  .entry-6 .placeholder { height: 96px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"watermark\">S</div>\n  <div class=\"bg-blob blob-right\"></div>\n  <div class=\"bg-blob blob-bottom\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry entry-1\">\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 卡里颂糖 —— 左侧图片]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">卡里颂糖</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      Calissons卡里颂糖是一种传统的法国糖果，由光滑、淡黄色、均匀的蜜饯（尤其是甜瓜和橙子）和杏仁粉组成，上面覆盖着一层薄薄的糖霜。它们的质地类似杏仁软糖，但具有更浓郁的果味和明显的甜瓜味。通常呈杏仁状，长约五厘米。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry entry-2\">\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 里昂枕巧克力 —— 左侧图片]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">里昂枕巧克力</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      Coussin de Lyon是里昂高级手工巧克力，绿色外皮是杏仁泥，中间有深色色的直线，内馅是调了些许酒的黑巧克力馅。以用杏仁和巧克力、柑橘清香闻名于世。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry entry-3\">\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 漂浮岛 —— 左侧图片]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">漂浮岛</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      île flottante 这个具有神秘又有趣名称的甜品是法国经典甜品之一。白白胖胖的蛋清浮在蛋奶做成的英式卡仕达酱上，就像是一座无人小岛。可爱又美味。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry entry-5\">\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 柠檬塔 —— 左侧图片]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">柠檬塔</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      Tarte au citron，一款历史悠久的美食，从南法城市Menton开始流行。每年的二、三月都会举办柠檬节，城中以柠檬与鲜花制作的花车游行最为盛名。在塔皮挤入柠檬奶油馅，再以蛋白饼或蛋白霜装饰，是现在常见的柠檬塔形式。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry entry-6\">\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 红酒炖梨 —— 左侧图片]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">红酒炖梨</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      Poire à la Beaujolaise，法国博若莱葡萄酒产区的传统甜点，果味红酒搭配糖或蜂蜜、丁香、胡椒、香草英等香料炖煮梨，梨充分入味，甜软飘香。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
